title: Make source-quality and exact 100/100/100 coverage gates fail closed repo-wide
description: "The current coverage gate measures src only at 81/77/88 and the repository lacks mandatory fail-closed lint, docstring-coverage, and duplication gates. This independently blocks production/publication readiness beyond the compatibility tranche."
